<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h3 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">Project Update</h3><a id="user-content-project-update" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Project Update" href="https://github.com/merkle-open/generator-nitro/tree/develop/packages/generator-nitro#project-update"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir="auto">If you start the generator in an existing project, you will be asked to update the project.
It is best to overwrite all local files and check the differences after.</p>
<p dir="auto">Updating to a new major version needs some more work. Please check the <a href="https://github.com/merkle-open/generator-nitro/releases">release notes</a></p>
