<p dir="auto">Available generators:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code>yo nitro</code> (aka <code>yo nitro:app</code> / generate or update a project)</li>
<li><code>yo nitro:pattern [name]</code> (create or update a pattern)</li>
<li><code>yo nitro:server</code> (create an executable light version of the project)</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Note: Generators are to be run from the root directory of your project.</p>
